BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Sonoma-Marin Brat Pack
UID:event_314553988@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260518T042802Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260519T181500
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260519T203000
SUMMARY:Trivia at Trailhead (Novato)
DESCRIPTION:Sonoma-Marin Brat Pack\n🎉 Join Us for Trivia Night! 🧠☕
 ️\nThis event is cross-posted with Sonoma Marin Brat Pack\, Marin County
  Millennials\, and North Bay 20s30s Meetup\, so RSVPs may not reflect the 
 full crowd.\n\nWe’re Team Quizzards! I’ll be at most events\, and if I
  can’t make it\, you’ll still find some friendly regulars there. Look 
 for us at the back of the coffee shop — come say hi and join the fun! 
 🎉\n\n🕡 Trivia kicks off promptly at 6:30 PM\, so swing by a bit earl
 ier if you'd like to grab a drink or something tasty to eat before we get 
 started. I plan to be there at 6 pm to try to get us a good table .\n📍 
 Location:\nTrailhead Coffee\n127 San Marin Drive\, Novato\, CA\nBring your
  friends\, your appetite\, and your A-game — see you there! 🙌
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/sonoma-marin-brat-pack/events/3145539
 88/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260430T020222Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260430T020222Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Sonoma-Marin Brat Pack
UID:event_314250106@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260518T042802Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260523T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260523T150000
SUMMARY:Marin Greek Festival
DESCRIPTION:Sonoma-Marin Brat Pack\nCome join us for an afternoon of sunsh
 ine\, great food\, and friendly people at the Marin Greek Festival! The fe
 stival runs all weekend at the Nativity of Christ Greek Orthodox Church in
  Novato\, and Saturday is the perfect day to go. Feast on authentic Greek 
 food\, sip some wine\, enjoy live music and dance performances\, and brows
 e the booths — it's a full-on *glendi* (that's Greek for "party\," and t
 hey mean it). The entry fee is $5\, food and wine are additional and free 
 parking is available at Pell Plaza (500 Redwood Blvd\, off Ignacio Blvd fr
 om Hwy 101)\, with a free shuttle running continuously between Pell Plaza 
 and the church campus. We'll board the shuttle at 12pm or soon after to he
 ad over to the festival.\n\nNeed more info? See the official event page:\n
 https://www.nativityofchrist.org/marin-greek-festival
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/sonoma-marin-brat-pack/events/3142501
 06/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260412T192618Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260412T192618Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
